---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Legal title="Terms of use" description="The terms for reading and using the free guides and articles on this site.">
  <h2>Who publishes this site</h2>
  <p>The guides and articles on this site are written by {site.author.name} and published by {site.legalTraderName}, trading as {site.name}, {site.author.city}. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. Full details are in the <a href="/imprint">imprint</a>.</p>

  <h2>Free to read</h2>
  <p>Everything published here is free to read. There is no account, no subscription and no paywall. The newsletter is optional, free, and can be left with one click.</p>
  <p>Subscribers are sent a free PDF guide (“{site.freeGuide.title}”) as a thank-you. It is yours to keep if you unsubscribe, and the same subject is covered in a free <a href={site.freeGuide.article}>article</a> for anyone who would rather not subscribe.</p>

  <h2>Using the material</h2>
  <p>You may use the prompts, checklists, tables and templates in the guides in your own work and in work for your clients, with or without changes.</p>
  <p>You may quote short passages with a link to the original page. You may not republish whole articles or guides, or substantial parts of them, on another site, in a product or in a paid offering without written permission. The same applies to the PDF sent to subscribers: use it and share what you learn, but do not redistribute or resell the file. Text, images and design remain © {site.legalTraderName}.</p>

  <h2>Accuracy</h2>
  <p>The guides describe tools, prices, platform rules and services as they were on the date shown on each page. They change. Check the official source before committing a budget, and treat every figure as an example to recalculate for your own case.</p>
  <p>The content is practical general information, not legal, tax, financial or professional advice, and the results you get depend on how you apply it. To the extent the law allows, the publisher is not liable for losses arising from the use of free content on this site.</p>

  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>Articles link to tools and services run by others. Those links are for convenience; their terms and privacy policies apply on their sites. Unless an article says otherwise, links are not paid placements.</p>

  <h2>Earlier purchases</h2>
  <p>Until {site.shopClosed} some guides were sold as PDF files. Those purchases remain governed by the terms of sale that applied when they were made. Questions about them go to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>, ideally from the address used to pay.</p>

  <h2>Applicable law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by Bulgarian law. If you live in the EU, you keep the protections of the law of your own country of residence.</p>
</Legal>
